# ============================================================================
#  .env.deploy.example  —  runtime config template for the Haptica voice stack
# ============================================================================
#  Generated from the live production .env.deploy on haptica-prod, 2026-07-17.
#
#  HOW TO USE:
#    cp deploy/.env.deploy.example deploy/.env.deploy
#    then fill in every EMPTY value below. Empty = it was a secret and was
#    deliberately stripped. Non-empty = the real production default, safe to keep.
#
#  66 of 238 keys are secrets you must supply. The other 172 carry working defaults.
#  NEVER commit the filled-in .env.deploy — .gitignore already blocks .env.*
# ============================================================================

